<title>UK: BGL sets 75 million euro six-year bond.</title>
<headline>BGL sets 75 million euro six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BGL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE GENERALE DU LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN EUR0   COUPON     5.50 PCT  MATURITY    27.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.04    PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
